config BR2_PACKAGE_SCHEDTOOL
	bool "schedtool"
	help
	  schedtool was born, because there was no tool to change or
	  query all CPU-scheduling policies under Linux, in one handy
	  command.  Support for CPU-affinity has also been added and
	  most recently (re-)nicing of processes.

	  Thus, schedtool is the definitive interface to Linux's scheduler.

	  https://github.com/freequaos/schedtool
